<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - INTERMEDIA COMMUNICATIONS.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - INTERMEDIA COMMUNICATIONS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon Read said Wednesday it started coverage of Intermedia Communications Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Set 12-18 month target price of $56 per share.</p>
<p>-- Expects company to post Q3 EBIDTA loss $13 million.</p>
<p>-- &quot;Once it covers its fixed costs, the company should begin generating significant operating profits starting in 2000...,&quot; Dillon Read analyst Bruce Roberts said in a research note.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/16 to 34-13/16.</p>
